sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant BE as Backend API
    participant Q as Queue Worker
    participant LLM as LLM Service
    participant DB as SQLite DB
    participant WS as Reverb WebSocket

    User->>FE: Upload document
    FE->>BE: POST /api/documents
    BE->>DB: Save Document (status: uploaded)
    BE->>Q: Dispatch ProcessDocumentJob
    BE-->>FE: 201 Created (immediate)

    Q->>LLM: POST /api/extract {text, document_type}
    LLM-->>Q: {requirements[]}
    Q->>DB: Save Requirements
    Q->>DB: Save ActivityLog entry
    Q->>DB: Create Notification record
    Q->>WS: Broadcast notification event
    WS-->>FE: Push to subscribed channel
    FE->>FE: NotificationBell badge +1
    FE->>FE: ActivityFeed updates
